                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "f31",
                      "name": "编号段",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "height": "fit_content",
                      "layout": "horizontal",
                      "gap": 120,
                      "alignItems": "start",
                      "fill": [],
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "t29",
                          "name": "段号",
                          "content": "§1.1",
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 26,
                          "fontWeight": 500,
                          "fill": [
                            {
                              "type": "solid",
                              "color": "$c-thread"
                            }
                          ],
                          "lineHeight": 2.077,
                          "letterSpacing": 0,
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": 96,
                          "textAlign": "right"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "f30",
                          "name": "段落",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "height": "fit_content",
                          "layout": "vertical",
                          "gap": 18,
                          "fill": [],
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "t28",
                              "name": "正文",
                              "content": "人工抽查按片区轮换，每家门店平均 47 天才被巡到一次。\n到店的检查项由巡检员当场手写，回办公室再录入系统，\n两个环节之间平均隔了 1.8 天，照片与表单常常对不上号。\n抽查本身没有错，错的是把抽查的结果当成了全量的结论。",
                              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                              "fontSize": 30,
                              "fontWeight": 400,
                              "fill": [
                                {
                                  "type": "solid",
                                  "color": "$c-ink"
                                }
                              ],
                              "lineHeight": 1.8,
                              "letterSpacing": 0,
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": 900
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "f35",
                      "name": "编号段",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "height": "fit_content",
                      "layout": "horizontal",
                      "gap": 120,
                      "alignItems": "start",
                      "fill": [],
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "t33",
                          "name": "段号",
                          "content": "§1.2",
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 26,
                          "fontWeight": 500,
                          "fill": [
                            {
                              "type": "solid",
                              "color": "$c-thread"
                            }
                          ],
                          "lineHeight": 2.077,
                          "letterSpacing": 0,
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": 96,
                          "textAlign": "right"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "f34",
                          "name": "段落",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "height": "fit_content",
                          "layout": "vertical",
                          "gap": 18,
                          "fill": [],
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "t32",
                              "name": "正文",
                              "content": "问题上报走工作群，群里同时还有排班、报修与日常通知。\n信息一旦被后面的消息顶下去，就等于没有发生过。\n上季度共 1342 条上报，能追溯到闭环记录的只有 611 条。",
                              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                              "fontSize": 30,
                              "fontWeight": 400,
                              "fill": [
                                {
                                  "type": "solid",
                                  "color": "$c-ink"
                                }
                              ],
                              "lineHeight": 1.8,
                              "letterSpacing": 0,
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": 900
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "f39",
                      "name": "编号段",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "height": "fit_content",
                      "layout": "horizontal",
                      "gap": 120,
                      "alignItems": "start",
                      "fill": [],
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "t37",
                          "name": "段号",
                          "content": "§1.3",
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 26,
                          "fontWeight": 500,
                          "fill": [
                            {
                              "type": "solid",
                              "color": "$c-thread"
                            }
                          ],
                          "lineHeight": 2.077,
                          "letterSpacing": 0,
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": 96,
                          "textAlign": "right"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "f38",
                          "name": "段落",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "height": "fit_content",
                          "layout": "vertical",
                          "gap": 18,
                          "fill": [],
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "t36",
                              "name": "正文",
                              "content": "各区域对同一个检查项的判定尺度并不一致：\n华东把冷链温度超标记为一般问题，华南记为严重问题，\n汇总到集团时，两者被加在了同一个数字里。",
                              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                              "fontSize": 30,
                              "fontWeight": 400,
                              "fill": [
                                {
                                  "type": "solid",
                                  "color": "$c-ink"
                                }
                              ],
                              "lineHeight": 1.8,
                              "letterSpacing": 0,
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": 900
                            }
                          ]
                        }
