                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "f169",
                          "name": "段落",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "height": "fit_content",
                          "layout": "vertical",
                          "gap": 18,
                          "fill": [],
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "t167",
                              "name": "正文",
                              "content": "抽查的样本由排班决定，而排班避开了最难去的那些门店。\n越是偏远、越是人手紧的门店，被巡到的间隔越长，\n于是问题最多的地方，恰好是我们了解得最少的地方。\n这不是执行不力，是抽样方法自带的偏差。",
                              "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
                              "fontSize": 30,
                              "fontWeight": 400,
                              "fill": [
                                {
                                  "type": "solid",
                                  "color": "$c-ink"
                                }
                              ],
                              "lineHeight": 1.8,
                              "letterSpacing": 0,
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": 900
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "f174",
                      "name": "编号段",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "height": "fit_content",
